{"4009360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Elevation Tower Defense", "steam_appid": 4009360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evil has befallen the lands and nature has been turned into an enemy. The rocks, ice, beasts and trees are on the move and it is up to you to use the power of the towers to defend the arctic, island, sky, desert, forest, and stone realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009360/extras/23221c5839863b308944793d5fe32190.poster.avif?t=1764037170\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009360/extras/23221c5839863b308944793d5fe32190.webm?t=1764037170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009360/extras/23221c5839863b308944793d5fe32190.mp4?t=1764037170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from rock, fire, magic, castle and healing towers - build them in the ideal spots and choose the best times to level up.  Earn points to level up by defeating enemies. Protect your base  and survive wave after wave of enemies.  Make it to the end of the waves and you win, but watch out for bosses and landscape changes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009360/extras/d6a60aaa9674e1b0dcb777a9c8bf6168.avif?t=1764037170\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Replay levels at different difficulty levels or try new combinations of towers for different battle styles. Survive the waves - free the realms - hold the high ground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009360/extras/8224d87ce83f635595a9fdf0910ae2a9.avif?t=1764037170\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >360 Degree Free View</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Towers with Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Difficulty Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of Enemies with Different Bosses Each Realm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual Play-style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrain-Changing and Multi-Zone Maps</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evil has befallen the lands and nature has been turned into an enemy. The rocks, ice, beasts and trees are on the move and it is up to you to use the power of the towers to defend the arctic, island, sky, desert, forest, and stone realms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009360/extras/23221c5839863b308944793d5fe32190.poster.avif?t=1764037170\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009360/extras/23221c5839863b308944793d5fe32190.webm?t=1764037170\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009360/extras/23221c5839863b308944793d5fe32190.mp4?t=1764037170\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from rock, fire, magic, castle and healing towers - build them in the ideal spots and choose the best times to level up.  Earn points to level up by defeating enemies. Protect your base  and survive wave after wave of enemies.  Make it to the end of the waves and you win, but watch out for bosses and landscape changes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009360/extras/d6a60aaa9674e1b0dcb777a9c8bf6168.avif?t=1764037170\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Replay levels at different difficulty levels or try new combinations of towers for different battle styles. Survive the waves - free the realms - hold the high ground!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4009360/extras/8224d87ce83f635595a9fdf0910ae2a9.avif?t=1764037170\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >360 Degree Free View</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple Towers with Upgrades</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Difficulty Levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of Enemies with Different Bosses Each Realm</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Casual Play-style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tutorial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High Scores</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrain-Changing and Multi-Zone Maps</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Take the high ground with Elevation Tower Defense - a fully 3D TD experience letting you experience the battle from all angles. Build and upgrade towers - fight off waves of enemies - watch o